{"schema_version":"appworld-codex-plan-v1","status":"needs_more_public_schema","failure_reason":"The public Spotify schema can find every EDM artist with at least 23 followers and follow them, but it provides no read endpoint or response field that reveals whether each artist is currently followed. The required post-mutation verification therefore cannot be performed.","missing_public_schema_fields":["A public Spotify read API or artist response field exposing the current user's followed status for each artist"],"task_id":"07b42fd_2","task_family":"07b42fd","completion_mode":"status_only","plan_summary":"A compliant executable plan cannot be produced until the public schema supports verification that every selected artist is followed after mutation.","steps":[]}